# Test artifacts — regenerated by every `playwright test` run, never reviewed
# from the repo. `test-results/` is the failure-artifact dir (error-context.md
# per failing test); `tests/report/` is the HTML reporter's output, set by
# playwright.config.ts.
test-results/
tests/report/

# Vitest writes a timestamped config shim next to the real one while it runs.
vitest.config.ts.timestamp-*.mjs
